    <p class="text-white text-sm leading-relaxed font-inter font-semibold">If a child is in
      <span class="underline underline-offset-2">immediate danger</span>, call
      <span class="text-yellow-200 text-base">999</span>
      first. Do not wait to contact the club.</p>
  </div>
  {# ── b) Welfare Officers card ──────────────────────────────── #}
