        <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.99 13 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.93 4.37 2 2 0 0 1
